<title>USA: Anthem Life to sell Community National Assurance.</title>
<headline>Anthem Life to sell Community National Assurance.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anthem Life Insurance Co of Indiana said Wednesday it agreed to sell the stock of Community National Assurance Co and a block of 22,000 individual life insurance policies to Protective Life Insurance Co.</p>
<p>Protective Life Insurance is a subsidiary of Protective Life Corp of Birmingham, Ala.</p>
<p>Details of the transactions were not disclosed. Anthem Life said the transaction will allow it to focus more on its group life and disability insurance business.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
